Waveshare ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 examples
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  firmware/rlcd_dash/st7305_u8g2.{h,cpp}
  diagnostics/audio_probe/**

    Derived from https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2
    Copyright (c) Waveshare
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    st7305_u8g2.{h,cpp} is a reworked version of the vendor example
    (02_Example/Arduino/10_U8G2_Test/ST7305_U8g2.cpp).  The panel init
    sequence and the 4-column x 2-row RAM repacking are the vendor's; the
    class layout, the inversion switch and the error handling are ours.
    Modifications are marked in the file headers.

    diagnostics/audio_probe/ contains the vendor audio stack verbatim
    (codec_bsp, i2c_bsp, codec_board, esp_codec_dev) with the music and LVGL
    parts removed, kept as a diagnostic reference.  See its README.

