esp_codec_dev (ES7210 driver subset)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  firmware/rlcd_dash/src/**

    https://github.com/espressif/esp-adf/tree/master/components/esp_codec_dev
    Copyright (c) Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    (diagnostics/audio_probe/.../codec_board is under the Espressif
    Modified MIT License; see that directory's LICENSE.)

    A subset: only the ES7210 ADC driver and the interfaces it needs.  The
    I2C transport is ours (src/serial-free ctrl_if in audio_level.cpp) so the
    codec can share the Arduino Wire bus with the SHTC3.

